# Real, rendered Blizzard game textures extracted from a local client install
# (importers/wow-client) — copyrighted game art, not our data. Never commit
# these to a public repo; regenerate locally with `npm run extract:minimaps
# --workspace=@atlas/importer-wow-client` (requires your own licensed client
# install; see importers/wow-client/README.md).
